QUASAR — dsh-quasar-theme — licence
===================================

Two licences split this package, by what each file is. Both travel with it, and
NOTICE carries the attribution each one asks for.

  * Our own code and documentation ....... MIT — use it, change it, ship it.
  * The two font files in build/ ......... SIL Open Font License 1.1.

Everything else in this package is MIT. Nothing in it is non-commercial, and no
third-party artwork is redistributed — the only image shipped is the brand mark
drawn for this theme (NOTICE).


1. Our own code — MIT
