2. Fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1
------------------------------------

2.1 build/cinzel-latin-700.woff2
    Cinzel, Copyright 2020 The Cinzel Project Authors.
    Latin subset taken from @fontsource, unmodified.

2.2 build/eb-garamond-latin-500.woff2
    EB Garamond, Copyright 2017 The EB Garamond Project Authors.
    Latin subset taken from @fontsource, unmodified.

Both files are embedded in the generated client.js as base64 data URLs, so they
reach anyone who receives the bundle. The OFL text for each ships beside it, as
build/cinzel-OFL.txt and build/eb-garamond-OFL.txt; the canonical copy is
https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

The OFL conditions, in short: the fonts may be used, studied, modified and
redistributed freely, including inside a commercial product, as long as they are
not sold by themselves, any derivative carries the same licence, and the
copyright notice and licence travel with them. This theme does not modify them.


3. What comes from where
------------------------

  index.js, src/, tools/, docs/, cordis.patch.yml ... MIT (section 1)
  build/brand-mark-black-hole.png ................... MIT (drawn for this theme)
  build/brand-mark-black-hole.png is the only image; NOTICE records its origin.
  build/cinzel-latin-700.woff2,
  build/eb-garamond-latin-500.woff2 ................. SIL OFL 1.1 (section 2)
  build/fonts.json, build/veil-budget.json,
  build/wallpapers.json ............................. MIT (section 1)
  client.js ......................................... MIT, generated from src/
